s://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2494796118","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99102#issuecomment-2494796118","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99102","id":2494796118,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Us5FW","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-22T21:03:18Z","updated_at":"2024-11-22T21:03:18Z","body":"Thanks! Congratulations on your first merged contribution! 🎉 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2494796118/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499762746","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99102#issuecomment-2499762746","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99102","id":2499762746,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U_1o6","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T06:22:26Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T06:22:26Z","body":"I'm sorry to be a bit of a downer on this, but at least would there be a way to change this behavior depending on whether or not Godot's internal editor is receiving the suggestions versus an external IDE? The new behavior is inconsistent with other languages in VS Code, where the parentheses are never given after brackets in the suggestion list or the actual completed code.\r\n\r\nCurrently, for GDScript, starting to type out `print`:\r\n![CleanShot 2024-11-25 at 22 16 04@2x](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a879107b-e98d-4e3d-80cd-16e5d0b67ffc)\r\nImmediately after hitting Enter/Return:\r\n![CleanShot 2024-11-25 at 22 16 19@2x](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/76c05fdf-8d9e-49af-a525-7be0a3c71f85)\r\n\r\nBy contrast, here are some other popular languages in VS Code:\r\n\r\nFor Python, starting to type out `print`:\r\n![CleanShot 2024-11-25 at 22 08 19@2x](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/709730bc-e7e9-4218-ba7f-7da464b6231c)\r\nImmediately after hitting Enter/Return:\r\n![CleanShot 2024-11-25 at 22 08 41@2x](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d7bbd11-9014-4679-8530-4ddab84d2aaf)\r\n\r\nFor TypeScript, starting to type out `console.log`:\r\n![CleanShot 2024-11-25 at 22 09 35@2x](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c877f99a-64a4-432a-ade8-ee6f74d67281)\r\nImmediately after hitting Enter/Return:\r\n![CleanShot 2024-11-25 at 22 09 43@2x](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7066fd84-9c6e-4368-8640-002f5c99a9ae)\r\n\r\nFor C/C++, starting to type out `print_line`:\r\n![CleanShot 2024-11-25 at 22 13 33@2x](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77a0c91a-5e7e-4709-921e-5d734019b9b0)\r\nImmediately after hitting Enter/Return:\r\n![CleanShot 2024-11-25 at 22 13 43@2x](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7b9b1fb3-ebf7-4210-b517-f36741f5fdd8)\r\n\r\nIt seems the standard is to not include parentheses in the suggestions for function/method names, and to not insert them once the user accepts the suggestion. Perhaps it makes more sense for Godot's built-in editor, but for external ones such as VS Code it looks to be different. IMO it'd make sense to either change the autocomplete behavior depending on the recipient (built-in editor vs external editor), or change the built-in editor's behavior so that it is more consistent with other language servers.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499762746/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2500237691","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99102#issuecomment-2500237691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99102","id":2500237691,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VBpl7","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T10:27:53Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T10:27:53Z","body":"I think only referencing language servers developed by Microsoft might be a bit biased (I suppose you are using the Microsoft c++ language server).\r\n\r\nHere are some counter examples:\r\n\r\nclangd C++ language server:\r\n![Screenshot From 2024-11-26 11-07-13](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fba5d21f-5805-4202-950f-1d4d38e6a869)\r\n![Screenshot From 2024-11-26 11-07-23](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06e9b6a6-bcf7-4c11-8361-e0fcc71247ff)\r\n\r\nDart integration\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b9da8bfe-76c7-493c-b262-5401a7df102a)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/69447237-c152-421e-a4b4-0d5416286845)\r\n\r\nJava (the oracle plugin)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b14cd8f-6682-4eaf-ad9b-f4e598daea78)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/43020651-01e7-406a-a261-27acb97fb2f2)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2500237691/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2501089336","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99102#issuecomment-2501089336","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99102","id":2501089336,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VE5g4","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T15:13:36Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T15:13:36Z","body":"Thanks for providing the counterexamples! You're right that they were all Microsoft-developed servers, as far as I know - my thought was that since Microsoft originally developed the specification, if there was a standard for how/when to do things like insert parentheses, the Microsoft servers would be the most likely to follow it to a T.\r\n\r\nThe [documentation for VS Code's Rust support on their website](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/languages/rust) features `rust-analyzer`, which also shows `(...)` after function/method names 🙂 \r\n\r\n![](https://code.visualstudio.com/assets/docs/languages/rust/code-completions.png)\r\n\r\nGiven that these other big language servers do it as well, I agree having the GDScript server do it is all good. 😄 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2501089336/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]